VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_WelcomeToBattleTent:
	.string "Welcome to the Verdanturf Battle\n"
	.string "Tent!\p"
	.string "Here, three Pokémon battle in\n"
	.string "pairs, and their Trainer only\l"
	.string "watches.$"

